            "detailed_description": "<h1>Simplified Chinese</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game only supports Simplified Chinese interface and subtitles for users on Windows operating system.</p></p><br><h1>Aviso sobre Fotossensibilidade</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Alguns conteúdos visuais, como padrões ou luzes intermitentes, podem afetar jogadores e espetadores fotossensíveis. Visita Xbox Support para mais informações.</p></p><br><h1>Acerca do jogo</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/607080/extras/2e3093115a18d4fa154e7c6ba89fa7ad.poster.avif?t=1793210474\" width=608 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/607080/extras/2e3093115a18d4fa154e7c6ba89fa7ad.webm?t=1793210474\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/607080/extras/2e3093115a18d4fa154e7c6ba89fa7ad.mp4?t=1793210474\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Razputin &quot;Raz&quot; Aquato, ágil acrobata e magnífico mentalista, cumpriu o seu sonho de fazer parte da organização internacional de espionagem psíquica conhecida como... Psychonauts! Mas agora, estes superespiões têm um pequeno problema. O líder não voltou a ser o mesmo desde que foi raptado e há alguém infiltrado na sede. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combinando missões divertidas com conspirações misteriosas, o Psychonauts 2 é um jogo de aventura e plataformas com um estilo único e inúmeros poderes personalizáveis. Controla o Raz numa viagem tão perigosa quanto hilariante através das mentes de amigos e inimigos até derrotares um psicovilão implacável. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/607080/extras/028a37eb5b5c13d3fc021fc132522f4b.poster.avif?t=1793210474\" width=608 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/607080/extras/028a37eb5b5c13d3fc021fc132522f4b.webm?t=1793210474\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/607080/extras/028a37eb5b5c13d3fc021fc132522f4b.mp4?t=1793210474\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Segue uma história criativa e com um estilo cinemático que combina humor e intriga, saída da mente do lendário Tim Schafer (Grim Fandango, Brütal Legend, Broken Age).</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/607080/extras/481ef65ed0c6bc4190dcd153e658232b.poster.avif?t=1793210474\" width=608 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/607080/extras/481ef65ed0c6bc4190dcd153e658232b.webm?t=1793210474\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/607080/extras/481ef65ed0c6bc4190dcd153e658232b.mp4?t=1793210474\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explora cenários únicos e mergulha nas mentes de outras personagens para derrotar demónios interiores, desbloquear recordações esquecidas e resolver problemas emocionais.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/607080/extras/affed6cffa4407d242dc19a02f531d8d.poster.avif?t=1793210474\" width=608 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/607080/extras/affed6cffa4407d242dc19a02f531d8d.webm?t=1793210474\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/607080/extras/affed6cffa4407d242dc19a02f531d8d.mp4?t=1793210474\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Faz saltos acrobáticos e atravessa pontes de cordas e trapézios em desafios variados, complexos e divertidos.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/607080/extras/28798650bed03e7c0f5f6087c171531a.poster.avif?t=1793210474\" width=608 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/607080/extras/28798650bed03e7c0f5f6087c171531a.webm?t=1793210474\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/607080/extras/28798650bed03e7c0f5f6087c171531a.mp4?t=1793210474\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Usa as capacidades mentais do Raz para destruir, queimar e levitar objetos ou retarda o passar do tempo para resolver quebra-cabeças e combater inimigos bizarros.</p></li></ul>",
            "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/607080/extras/2e3093115a18d4fa154e7c6ba89fa7ad.poster.avif?t=1793210474\" width=608 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/607080/extras/2e3093115a18d4fa154e7c6ba89fa7ad.webm?t=1793210474\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/607080/extras/2e3093115a18d4fa154e7c6ba89fa7ad.mp4?t=1793210474\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Razputin &quot;Raz&quot; Aquato, ágil acrobata e magnífico mentalista, cumpriu o seu sonho de fazer parte da organização internacional de espionagem psíquica conhecida como... Psychonauts! Mas agora, estes superespiões têm um pequeno problema. O líder não voltou a ser o mesmo desde que foi raptado e há alguém infiltrado na sede. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combinando missões divertidas com conspirações misteriosas, o Psychonauts 2 é um jogo de aventura e plataformas com um estilo único e inúmeros poderes personalizáveis. Controla o Raz numa viagem tão perigosa quanto hilariante através das mentes de amigos e inimigos até derrotares um psicovilão implacável. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/607080/extras/028a37eb5b5c13d3fc021fc132522f4b.poster.avif?t=1793210474\" width=608 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/607080/extras/028a37eb5b5c13d3fc021fc132522f4b.webm?t=1793210474\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/607080/extras/028a37eb5b5c13d3fc021fc132522f4b.mp4?t=1793210474\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Segue uma história criativa e com um estilo cinemático que combina humor e intriga, saída da mente do lendário Tim Schafer (Grim Fandango, Brütal Legend, Broken Age).</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/607080/extras/481ef65ed0c6bc4190dcd153e658232b.poster.avif?t=1793210474\" width=608 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/607080/extras/481ef65ed0c6bc4190dcd153e658232b.webm?t=1793210474\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/607080/extras/481ef65ed0c6bc4190dcd153e658232b.mp4?t=1793210474\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explora cenários únicos e mergulha nas mentes de outras personagens para derrotar demónios interiores, desbloquear recordações esquecidas e resolver problemas emocionais.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/607080/extras/affed6cffa4407d242dc19a02f531d8d.poster.avif?t=1793210474\" width=608 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/607080/extras/affed6cffa4407d242dc19a02f531d8d.webm?t=1793210474\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/607080/extras/affed6cffa4407d242dc19a02f531d8d.mp4?t=1793210474\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Faz saltos acrobáticos e atravessa pontes de cordas e trapézios em desafios variados, complexos e divertidos.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/607080/extras/28798650bed03e7c0f5f6087c171531a.poster.avif?t=1793210474\" width=608 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/607080/extras/28798650bed03e7c0f5f6087c171531a.webm?t=1793210474\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/607080/extras/28798650bed03e7c0f5f6087c171531a.mp4?t=1793210474\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Usa as capacidades mentais do Raz para destruir, queimar e levitar objetos ou retarda o passar do tempo para resolver quebra-cabeças e combater inimigos bizarros.</p></li></ul>",
